uy Gamestock shares.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's possible.<br /> <br /> Then again, the classic image of the Syndicate it's them supporting megafunds, not throwing them under the bus to them have 'em rescued by the political power. More so, market whales asking (and likely getting?) more regulations to the state doesn't seem like the kind of things they would typically do. Supposedly the Syndicate IT'S Wall Street, and all of these financial moguls are *angry*<br /> <br /> And memeing something into existence it's a very VA thing to do...<br /> <br /> I could see it both ways, trully. The Syndicate goes deeper than the place where mere crowdunds have their money, and perhaps they are seeing the big picture here...<br /> Heck, it could go both ways for the Syndicate too: They could be allowing the free market take it's course, but conversely having whales ask for <i>more regulations </i>could lead people to accept the regulations (not because they want them, but because ppl are accustomed to richs having their way). Migth be the whole point, as that would allow the powerful (them) more control. After all, what are Regulations if not Wards &amp; Countermeasures (so to speak) :P ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 01-28-2021, 11:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-28T09:40:50-08:00","id":1433715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originall